OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fshowers and longer spells of rain in
OL,7,Fthe east, becoming more settled and
OL,8,Fdrier overnight with clearing skies
OL,9,Ffrom the west. Winds will ease
OL,10,Fslightly by the morning inland but
OL,11,Fremaining strong around the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FCool start Saturday, but
OL,14,Fturning wet and windy with rain
OL,15,Fspreading east from mid-morning,
OL,16,Fbecoming heavy at times. Winds will
OL,17,Fstrengthen further during the
OL,18,Fafternoon with coastal gales possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
